{"step_index":393,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T04:02:44Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-28T07:02:44+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-28T07:02:44+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///Y:/STRG/tick_aggregator.py`\nTotal Lines: 153\nTotal Bytes: 5963\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: \"\"\"\r\n2: tick_aggregator.py\r\n3: Быстрый парсер тиков и сборщик японских свечей (OHLCV) + расчёт фракталов.\r\n4: \"\"\"\r\n5: \r\n6: import pandas as pd\r\n7: import numpy as np\r\n8: from datetime import datetime\r\n9: import glob\r\n10: from fractal_zigzag import calculate_fractal_zigzag\r\n11: \r\n12: \r\n13: class TickAggregator:\r\n14:     def __init__(self, file_path=None):\r\n15:         self.file_path = file_path\r\n16:         self.df_ticks = None\r\n17:         self.last_pivots = []\r\n18: \r\n19:     def load_all_files(self, file_paths=None):\r\n20:         \"\"\"Загружает все доступные тиковые файлы и склеивает их в единый сквозной поток.\"\"\"\r\n21:         if not file_paths:\r\n22:             file_paths = sorted(glob.glob(\"Y:/MXU6_*.txt\"))\r\n23:         if not file_paths:\r\n24:             return False\r\n25: \r\n26:         dfs = []\r\n27:         for fp in file_paths:\r\n28:             try:\r\n29:                 df = pd.read_csv(\r\n30:                     fp,\r\n31:                     usecols=[2, 3, 4, 5],\r\n32:                     names=[\"DATE\", \"TIME\", \"PRICE\", \"VOL\"],\r\n33:                     header=0,\r\n34:                     dtype={\"DATE\": str, \"TIME\": str, \"PRICE\": float, \"VOL\": int}\r\n35:                 )\r\n36:                 time_str = df[\"TIME\"].str.zfill(6)\r\n37:                 dt_str = df[\"DATE\"] + time_str\r\n38:                 df[\"DATETIME\"] = pd.to